Third-party components
======================

vendor/X4_Python_Pipe_Server
----------------------------
From https://github.com/bvbohnen/x4-projects (SirNukes' Mod Support APIs),
MIT licensed by its own authors. Fetched from master on 2026-08-19 and
committed here to pin the version.

This is the named-pipe host that lets an external process talk to a running
X4: Foundations. It is the component this whole project is built on, and the
credit for it belongs to that project.

Local modification: `permissions.json` has the entry `x4_agent_bridge` added,
because the host only loads Python modules from extensions listed there.

See vendor/README.md for details.
